Run migrations from the backend directory after configuring DATABASE_URL:

	python -m alembic upgrade head

Create a new migration after changing SQLAlchemy models:

	python -m alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe the change"

To roll back one revision:

	python -m alembic downgrade -1

The initial schema is followed by additive migrations. Do not edit an already-applied migration on a shared database.
